# Fixed defect 2379, 2026-11-10, lane b29-pkgmsg, a shape beside it: a file
# of the package `core` reads `mine` as a value, which only the program's own
# `other/strings` declares. It was told `unknown_name` with a near name's
# rename; it is told the module and why no line of the package reaches it.
use <core>/strings

use other/strings as own

function main()
    print(strings.word() + own.mine())
